#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:9
msgid "Physics Backends"
msgstr "物理后端"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:11
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab supports three physics backends behind its common asset, sensor, "
"and scene APIs. Choose the backend that matches the runtime and solver "
"family you need, then choose a preset that the target task exposes. See "
":ref:`backends-and-presets` for preset selection and :ref:`backend-"
"architecture` for the implementation architecture."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 在统一的资源、传感器和场景 API "
"之下支持三种物理后端。先根据运行时和求解器系列的需求选择后端，再选择目标任务提供的预设。预设选择见 :ref:`backends-and-"
"presets` ，实现架构见 :ref:`backend-architecture` 。"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:19
msgid "Backend and solver terminology"
msgstr "后端与求解器的术语"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:21
msgid ""
"A **backend** integrates a physics runtime with Isaac Lab and owns "
"simulation lifecycle and data exchange. A **solver** is the numerical method"
" that advances the physical state within that backend. Newton is therefore "
"not synonymous with MJWarp: Newton hosts MJWarp, Kamino, VBD, MPM, and other"
" solver paths."
msgstr ""
"**后端** 将物理运行时集成到 Isaac Lab 中，负责仿真生命周期和数据交换。 **求解器** "
"是在后端内部推进物理状态的数值方法。因此，Newton 不等同于 MJWarp：Newton 支持 MJWarp、Kamino、VBD、MPM "
"等多种求解器。"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:26
msgid ""
"A **physics preset** is a task-supported configuration that selects a "
"backend and, when applicable, one of its solvers. Solver settings and "
"behavior are not numerically portable between solver families. Expect to "
"retune a task when changing solvers; see :ref:`solver-differences`."
msgstr ""
"**物理预设** "
"是任务支持的配置，用于选择后端，以及适用时该后端中的某个求解器。不同求解器系列之间，设置与行为在数值上不能直接对应。切换求解器时，应做好重新调参的准备，详见"
" :ref:`solver-differences` 。"

